    "id": "390995",
    "original": "俗説で「玉レタスを4分の1程度食べると眠くなる」と言われ、韓国では仕事前のドライバーが食べてはいけない食べ物として知られている。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "390998",
        "text": "In Korea, there's a popular theory that says that: \"If you eat a quarter of an Iceberg lettuce, you will fall asleep\". Thus, amongst truck drivers in Korea, lettuce is known as something that should not be eaten before work."
